  "question": {
    "text": "The vector <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math> is rotated through a right angle, passing through the <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi></math>-axis in its way and the resulting vector is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math>. Then the projection of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></math> on <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>c</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math> is"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></math>",
